===Etymology===
{{ety|en|id=work|:inh|enm:dixionare<id:dictionary>|:afeq|diction|-ary|tree=1}}

From {{inh|en|enm|dixionare}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=dicciọ̄nārīe|pos=n|id=MED11549.5}}</ref> a {{glossary|learned borrowing}} from {{der|en|la-med|dictiōnārium}}, from {{der|en|la|dictiōnārius}}, from {{m|la|dictiō||a speaking}}, from {{m|la|dictus}}, perfect past participle of {{m|la|dīcō|t= to speak}} + {{m|la|-ārium|t=room, place}}. {{surf|en|diction|-ary}}.

